Package: positively
Title: Diagnose Positivity Violations and Extrapolation in Causal Inference
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Malcolm", "Barrett", , "malcolmbarrett@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0299-5825"))
Description: Provides diagnostics for positivity violations and
    extrapolation in causal inference. Includes methods based on
    effective data points, positivity regression trees, hat values,
    highest density regions, density ratios, and parametric bootstrap
    bias estimates, covering binary, categorical, and continuous
    exposures as well as time-varying treatments. Each diagnostic
    returns a tidy result object and an optional plot. The package
    reports diagnostics only and does not assign severity grades or
    recommend remediation.
URL: https://r-causal.github.io/positively/,
    https://github.com/r-causal/positively
BugReports: https://github.com/r-causal/positively/issues
